{
  "about": "The Kitzur Shulchan Aruch Yomi luach: one entry per day of each Hebrew month, a range of siman:se'if (E: the siman's last se'if), the same every year. Transcribed from kitzurSa.json of @hebcal/learning 6.13.1 (https://github.com/hebcal/hebcal-learning), whose notes name the Hebrew Blum edition of the Kitzur and an Adar II track suggested by Rav Chaim Kanievsky; Hebcal names no printed luach. Each entry the build and its test found broken against Sefaria's text (221 simanim, 2765 se'ifim) is listed in corrections with the published value. Read by scripts/halacha/build.js; never edited by hand without a correction entry.",
